00:28:46.680 --> 00:28:51.680
>> So, franchising is all about systems and

00:28:48.920 --> 00:28:54.000
processes. What we do is we have one

00:28:51.680 --> 00:28:56.240
centralized internet that all franchise

00:28:54.000 --> 00:28:58.560
