So, we have videos shot Tik Tok style.

00:29:01.680 --> 00:29:05.560
So, we have videos on how to make every

00:29:02.880 --> 00:29:07.760
single product. We have all the SOPs,

00:29:05.560 --> 00:29:09.560
links to all of our tech stack, all of

00:29:07.760 --> 00:29:11.800
the tech platforms that we use.

00:29:09.560 --> 00:29:13.240
Everything is all on there. So, I can

00:29:11.800 --> 00:29:14.720
take you right now, I can put you behind

00:29:13.240 --> 00:29:17.440
the register, you'll be able to ring up

00:29:14.720 --> 00:29:18.800
a guest because it's it's so easy.

