For people listening, growing brand

00:29:25.480 --> 00:29:28.240
awareness is really tough. How did you

00:29:27.160 --> 00:29:29.000
grow brand awareness and like how much

00:29:28.240 --> 00:29:30.760
did it cost?

00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:33.520
>> Well, I'll tell you one of the best ways

00:29:30.760 --> 00:29:35.520
to grow brand awareness and to do it as

00:29:33.520 --> 00:29:37.360
inexpensively as possible is social

00:29:35.520 --> 00:29:40.120
media. And I'll tell you that one of the

00:29:37.360 --> 00:29:42.120
most expensive ways is whenever you have

00:29:40.120 --> 00:29:44.120
to educate the market. Let's say it's a

00:29:42.120 --> 00:29:46.000
it's an exotic product that not many

00:29:44.120 --> 00:29:48.120
people have heard about. If you're going

00:29:46.000 --> 00:29:49.960
to work on brand awareness with some

00:29:48.120 --> 00:29:52.120
exotic ingredient that no one knows

00:29:49.960 --> 00:29:54.360
about, that's going to cost a fortune.

00:29:52.120 --> 00:29:55.720
So, for us at Pure Green, we still we

00:29:54.360 --> 00:29:59.320
stay away from that. We only want to

00:29:55.720 --> 00:30:00.840
work with proven trends and that's been

00:29:59.320 --> 00:30:02.120
the one of the keys to our success.

00:30:00.840 --> 00:30:03.520
>> If someone had a thousand dollars to

00:30:02.120 --> 00:30:05.560
spend on marketing, would you say go

00:30:03.520 --> 00:30:06.920
find influencers that will work with you

00:30:05.560 --> 00:30:08.160
for less than a thousand dollars and

00:30:06.920 --> 00:30:08.640
grow that way or is that what you would

00:30:08.160 --> 00:30:10.040
tell them or

00:30:08.640 --> 00:30:12.000
>> I would say just build really great

00:30:10.040 --> 00:30:13.520
organic content so it doesn't even cost

00:30:12.000 --> 00:30:14.720
you anything. If you're working with

00:30:13.520 --> 00:30:16.080
some of the top influencers with

00:30:14.720 --> 00:30:17.240
millions of followers, that's going to

00:30:16.080 --> 00:30:19.360
be very costly. And sometimes you'll get

00:30:17.240 --> 00:30:20.920
a lot better results with these micro

00:30:19.360 --> 00:30:23.400
influencers that especially if you're in

00:30:20.920 --> 00:30:24.560
a local market, just find people just in

00:30:23.400 --> 00:30:26.760
the town. They may not have many

