you've ever read and how'd you put that

00:36:29.440 --> 00:36:32.240
in action?

00:36:30.240 --> 00:36:34.320
>> For me, it would be the classic Think

00:36:32.240 --> 00:36:37.200
and Grow Rich by Napoleon Hill. That one

