was just so so great at thinking big,

00:36:37.200 --> 00:36:41.640
being hungry, being passionate,

00:36:39.600 --> 00:36:43.560
executing, and just having a very

00:36:41.640 --> 00:36:46.480
specific goal, and really getting your

00:36:43.560 --> 00:36:48.200
psychology and your mindset right. That

00:36:46.480 --> 00:36:49.480
book really helped me.

00:36:48.200 --> 00:36:51.040
>> You send your team to training,

00:36:49.480 --> 00:36:52.600
leadership, and even Tony Robbins

00:36:51.040 --> 00:36:55.600
events. How important was that?

00:36:52.600 --> 00:36:57.880
>> So, we really believe in developing our

00:36:55.600 --> 00:36:59.760
people. With our corporate team, we want

